          <Page isRef="1053" />
          <Parent isRef="1053" />
          <Text>Only an application form with complete requirements and attachments will be processed. Application found with incomplete requirements will be given 15 calendar days to comply. Failure to comply within the prescribed period, the application will be deemed disapproved.</Text>
